B2

this is the line that if it removed their o way to count capital or low vowels and it the one make it happen 
=>  "if (vowels.contains(text[i]))"
The expression vowels.contains(text[i]) checks whether the current character in text is a vowel, 
returning true if it is found in the vowels string and false otherwise.
