void main() {
for (int i = 0; i < 6; i++) {
if (i == 2) continue;
if (i == 4) break;
print(i);
}
} 
the output will be 
0
1
3

becouse on i == 0 continue key word tells as to jump go to the next and when i == 4 break key word stops the the loop.
