void main() {
int day = 2;
switch (day) {
case 1:
case 2:
print('Early week');
case 3:
print('Midweek');
default:
print('Weekend soon');
}
} 
the output will be 
Early week
becouse the switch get value stored in variable day which is 2 then operates the case 2 to print the string.
